ut his pass doesn't find Rapha.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114449377846608000", "text": "6' Anthony Gordon's shot on target is saved by Lunin.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114449909034172893", "text": "Lamine toying with Cucurella. \ud83d\ude02", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2114449457538338816/pu/vid/avc1/1280x720/1w1EZvTk1wtc3PIl.mp4?tag=12"}, {"id": "2114451021246206266", "text": "13' YELLOW CARD FORGIVEN FOR CUCURELLA. UNREAL!", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114451427938521321", "text": "14' Another shot taken by Gordon. He's getting into the game.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114452189095563729", "text": "17' Brilliant defending by Xavi Espart to deny Mbappe.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114453180155097241", "text": "21' Brilliant run by Pedri into the box and the ball drops perfectly for Raphinha, whose effort goes over.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114453653012582558", "text": "23' BRILLIANT PLAY BY BAR\u00c7A BUT RAPHINHA'S SHOT IS JUST WIDE.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114453748219064401", "text": "Ferm\u00edn skillmaster \ud83d\udd25", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2114452950336552960/pu/vid/avc1/1280x720/1epB70qXTrODCSnb.mp4?tag=12"}, {"id": "2114454486496280938", "text": "STOP THAT LAMINE \ud83d\udd25", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114454678251430382", "text": "We missed our Spotify Camp Nou like this. \ud83d\udc99\u2764", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114446783757561856/vid/avc1/1280x720/xg_yyN13H3zQ5xmG.mp4?tag=14"}, {"id": "2114454881633276127", "text": "\ud83d\udea8 XAVI ESPART IS INJURED AND CAN'T CONTINUE.\n\nALEJANDRO BALDE COMING ON!", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114455150551064877", "text": "Another defensive injury \ud83